      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I checked my own worlds and noticed the same frame rate drop, I then checked the basic VRChat Home world and noticed that it's there too.\n\nI noticed that OVR Metrics shows a better frame rate than the one indicated in the debug menu. Seems the menu causes quite a drop itself.",
