      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The severe frame drop issue was replicable on Quest Pro (v56).\n\nI've cleared all content caches, switched to Robot—the most commonly used official avatar—and entered a new Invite-Only Instance of VRChat Home, which is the most popular world. I've checked the performance, and the results can be seen in the attached image.\n\nTherefore, it appears that this issue is not related to the META QUEST firmware, the avatar, or the world. Instead, it seems to be associated with some changes that were made when the VRChat client was updated to Unity 2022.3.5.\n\nNaturally, the performance worsens as more people enter the instance, making it practically impossible to enjoy VRChat comfortably. This issue clearly needs to be addressed before the Open Beta phase concludes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "64f1f3c9a712e40936485d2a",
