      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}: \n\nJust to confirm, I've carried out a frame rate comparison on my Quest Pro after performing a factory reset. This involved uninstalling and then reinstalling both the VRChat app and VRChat [Beta] app.\n\nThe frame rates for both versions were indeed consistent, confirming that the issue has been resolved. Thank you for addressing the problem!",
